# Getty's Synoname and Its Cousins: A Survey of Applications of Personal Name-Matching Algorithms.

**Authors:** Borgman, Christine L., Siegfried, Susan L.

## Abstract
Discusses problems of matching personal names in information systems and factors influencing design of personal name matching algorithms. Several examples of name matching systems in the fields of art history, bibliography, commerce, genealogy, and law enforcement used for the purposes of authority control, information retrieval, and duplicate detection are described. (72 references) (MES)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ450352

